    "text": "$\\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\left(\\frac{\\int_{x^3}^{(\\pi / 2)^3}\\left(\\sin \\left(2 t^{1 / 3}\\right)+\\cos \\left(t^{1 / 3}\\right)\\right) d t}{\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)^2}\\right)$\nis equal to",
